## 1. RED-PROOF A — Break plugin entrypoint (SPEC §2.5 tool registration)

Condition asserted: `activate`/`buildHarnessTools` registers exactly the five
tools `file_hash_read, file_hash_edit, ast_structural_search,
ast_structural_rewrite, ui_geometry_audit` (HARNESS_TOOL_NAMES ↔ tool table).

Sabotage (minimal, via native edit — no bash file writes):
  file: src/index.ts
  old: export const HARNESS_TOOL_NAMES = [\n  "file_hash_read",
  new: export const HARNESS_TOOL_NAMES = [\n  "file_hash_read_BROKEN",
  Effect: registration loop registers a phantom name; `tools["file_hash_read"]`
  is undefined while the tool table still keys the real name → mismatch.

